			<div class="work-content" style="text-align: center;">
			<h2>Catalogue</h2>
			<p>I tried out many approaches for the representation of the actual products. I benchmarked lots of premium paint shops and ended up using a wall texture with slight rough details.</p>

			<p>It was already decided that the paints would come in aluminium cans instead of traditional plastic buckets. I photoshopped a can to match Helsingö’s brand to visualise the idea and made an hover interaction for the paint items in order to instantly have another view of the paint.</p>

			<p>Customers could also order A4 samples to get a better idea of the colour, so I added the ability to add the samples to the cart from the list items.</p>
